=\frac{b/(2R)}{ac/(2R)^{2}}
=\frac{2R}{b}
=\frac{1}{\sin B}
=\frac{4\sqrt{7}}{7}\]所以\(\cot A+\cot C=\dfrac{4\sqrt{7}}{7}\).

• 由向量\(\overrightarrow{BA}\)与\(\overrightarrow{BC}\)的夹角为\(B\)，得\[\overrightarrow{BA}\cdot\overrightarrow{BC}=ac\cos B\]由题设\(ac\cos B=\dfrac32\)，且\(\cos B=\dfrac34\)，所以\(ac=2\). 结合\(b^{2}=ac\)，得\(b^{2}=2\). 再由余弦定理，\[a^{2}+c^{2}=b^{2}+2ac\cos B=2+3=5\]于是\[(a+c)^{2}=a^{2}+c^{2}+2ac=5+4=9\]因为边长为正数，所以\(a+c=3\).

